顺序校正","quote_sha256":"9177f28597ae5aefeffcc86e4d542f225fb20ca1f7620073f40ab8fc82d7521a","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_56b96348f0f97cd896c4:r5:3b8925778cb6ff75","span_id":"es_003"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_56b96348f0f97cd896c4:revision:5","quote":"第12周NT-proBNP较基线变化百分比（中心实验室）","quote_sha256":"e777be2e531186c75bac394b932a9171a08569e18bcb0166caf7ea5e61a9665e","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_56b96348f0f97cd896c4:r5:3b8925778cb6ff75","span_id":"es_004"},{"locator":"section:8 统计学考虑|block:1056|chunk:1","quote":"有效性评价、安全性评价、PK 评价、PD 评价、免疫原性评价以及其他分析将在本研究的统计分析计划（SAP）中详细规定，数据库锁定前将最终确定 SAP。","quote_sha256":"a635fe9c51c78cbc66090c3553c488cd453e807e61608a97e0767740d5088a03","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a3cf98aab983c7","span_id":"es_010"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_001","es_002","es_003","es_004","es_010"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":1,"project_fact_spans":4},"gap_items":[{"action":"需医学经理与统计师协商确定重大方案偏离的具体判定标准（依从性阈值、关键访视缺失定义、禁限用药违反等）","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_pps_deviation_criteria","missing_source_classes":["方案偏离判定标准文件","依从性阈值定义"],"target":"符合方案集重大方案偏离排除条款"},{"action":"待统计分析计划定稿后补充","category":"source_not_retrieved","gap_id":"gap_sap_detail","missing_source_classes":["统计分析计划"],"target":"各分析集缺失数据处理规则"}],"heading":"统计分析数据集","missing_source_classes":["方案偏离判定标准文件","依从性阈值定义","禁限合并用药清单"],"proposal_text":"本研究设置以下三个分析集。全分析集（FAS）：纳入所有经随机化分配的受试者，无论其是否实际接受研究药物治疗或完成研究，以随机化时的治疗组别为分析分组依据，用于主要疗效终点及次要疗效终点的意向性分析。安全性分析集（SS）：纳入至少接受一次研究药物（KZ-sGC2301或匹配安慰剂）给药的受试者，以实际接受的治疗组别为分析分组依据，用于所有安全性指标的分析，包括治疗期不良事件发生率与严重程度、生命体征、心电图及实验室检查异常、症状性低血压等。符合方案集（PPS）：纳入完成第12周主要疗效评估（NT-proBNP中心实验室检测）且无重大方案偏离的受试者；重大方案偏离包括但不限于：未接受任何研究药物治疗、依从性低于方案规定阈值、违反主要入选或排除标准入组、在主要疗效评估前接受禁限合并用药或救援治疗等情形，存在上述重大方案偏离者不纳入符合方案集。符合方案集用于主要疗效终点的敏感性分析，以评估方案偏离对主要结论的潜在影响。各分析集的具体成员判定细则、缺失数据处理规则及分析集间交叉验证方法将在统计分析计划中进一步细化，统计分析计划于数据库锁定前最终确定。","rationale":"FAS成员规则依据随机化设计事实（随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组）；SS成员规则依据治疗期安全性终点定义（TEAE、生命体征/ECG/实验室异常、症状性低血压）；PPS排除条款依据主要终点为第12周NT-proBNP较基线变化百分比这一关键评估节点。重大方案偏离的具体阈值（如依从性百分比、禁限用药清单）需医学经理与统计师共同确认。","review_advisories":["本节引用公司语料形成共性表述；定稿时请用本项目权威文件复核适用性。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_c2b4f6b36cfa_c8f32a6c16dc61ab","section_number":"9.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:2591f2474764bad43f94f2ce","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_56b96348f0f97cd896c4:r5:3b8925778cb6ff75","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3152bfe8bf762f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:2bfb4cb52d6d07","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a3cf98aab983c7","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:46d82ed9e2e3ef","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261015080613_9420285e","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_56b96348f0f97cd896c4:revision:5","quote":"主要终点ANCOVA基线校正；分层校正；敏感性分析与亚组分析预定义；次要终点按层次检验顺序校正","quote_sha256":"9177f28597ae5aefeffcc86e4d542f225fb20ca1f7620073f40ab8fc82d7521a","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_56b96348f0f97cd896c4:r5:3b8925778cb6ff75","span_id":"es_003"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_56b96348f0f97cd896c4:revision:5","quote":"第12周NT-proBNP较基线变化百分比（中心实验室）","quote_sha256":"e777be2e531186c75bac394b932a9171a08569e18bcb0166caf7ea5e61a9665e","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_56b96348f0f97cd896c4:r5:3b8925778cb6ff75","span_id":"es_004"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_56b96348f0f97cd896c4:revision:5","quote":"主要终点ANCOVA基线校正；分层校正；敏感性与亚组分析预定义；次要终点层次检验","quote_sha256":"362651d366de6c31219acf0fb577b1064726ef7d07d0494d52cf495f1190b61f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_56b96348f0f97cd896c4:r5:3b8925778cb6ff75","span_id":"es_005"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_56b96348f0f97cd896c4:revision:5","quote":"双侧α=0.10、效能85%，每组85例总计255例（含脱落补偿）","quote_sha256":"c01b830c42bf6a7ed1dc31d8d39332caf74ecca6643431e33eea621343f01d30","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_56b96348f0f97cd896c4:r5:3b8925778cb6ff75","span_id":"es_006"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_56b96348f0f97cd896c4:revision:5","quote":"安慰剂匹配双模拟对照，随机2:1:1（高剂量/低剂量/安慰剂），双盲","quote_sha256":"85987a4a57e6d50e7ee5d4148e4576b6850146838b44368fa4c5292250dd1e8e","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_56b96348f0f97cd896c4:r5:3b8925778cb6ff75","span_id":"es_007"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_56b96348f0f97cd896c4:revision:5","quote":"治疗政策策略主要估计目标，伴发事件处置预定义","quote_sha256":"d009c5539527e8c1f91b4a5cf381f9337364ec5866e0eec8431325e4ec9b8729","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_56b96348f0f97cd896c4:r5:3b8925778cb6ff75","span_id":"es_009"},{"locator":"section:8 统计学考虑|block:1056|chunk:1","quote":"有效性评价、安全性评价、PK 评价、PD 评价、免疫原性评价以及其他分析将在本研究的统计分析计划（SAP）中详细规定，数据库锁定前将最终确定 SAP。","quote_sha256":"a635fe9c51c78cbc66090c3553c488cd453e807e61608a97e0767740d5088a03","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a3cf98aab983c7","span_id":"es_010"},{"locator":"section:6.3.3 揭盲|block:488|chunk:1","quote":"在所有参与者（包括脱落和提前终止治疗）完成最后一次研究访视，完成数据清理、数据库锁定后，将对项目进行统一揭盲并进行统计分析。","quote_sha256":"d201ce569054cbbf7236ebc38a81549ab6777a6cd5f2fedc31a501f7bd4655a7","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:46d82ed9e2e3ef","span_id":"es_011"},{"locator":"section:评价CMS-D001在中度至重度特应性皮炎患者中的有效性和安全性的多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照的Ⅱ期临床研究|block:42|chunk:1","quote":"本统计单位将根据《药物临床试验质量管理规范》的规定，认真履行统计人员职责，保证遵循已批准的方案进行统计分析和处理，保证本研究所有信息、数据真实准确、完整无误，且不用于其他临床试验中。","quote_sha256":"85c12adb57d7e4840e02d045e114b2097ce5d40213d4a0f4198e48166b460b6a","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:2bfb4cb52d6d07","span_id":"es_013"},{"locator":"section:参考文献：|block:48|chunk:1","quote":"国家药品监督管理局药品审评中心. 药物临床试验数据管理与统计分析计划指导原则. 2021年.","quote_sha256":"9a9f3dc0d904c2d48a939e7baaaaf39c4e89deb4067ed241f98001500d36bd56","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3152bfe8bf762f","span_id":"es_014"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_003","es_004","es_005","es_006","es_007","es_009","es_010","es_011","es_013","es_014"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":4,"project_fact_spans":6},"gap_items":[{"action":"需确认分层因素（如基线NT-proBNP水平、NYHA分级、中心）及校正方式","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_stratification_factors","missing_source_classes":["分层因素定义文件"],"target":"ANCOVA模型中分层校正的具体因子"},{"action":"需医学经理确认亚组因素清单及分析策略","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_subgroup_list","missing_source_classes":["亚组分析方案"],"target":"预定义亚组分析因素"},{"action":"需在统计分析计划中明确伴发事件（如心衰住院、紧急再血管化）的处置策略","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_concomitant_handling","missing_source_classes":["估计目标定义文件"],"target":"伴发事件处置方式"}],"heading":"统计分析一般原则","missing_source_classes":["分层因素具体变量清单","亚组分析因素列表","伴发事件处置具体方式","统计分析计划"],"proposal_text":"本研究的统计分析遵循《药物临床试验质量管理规范》及国家药品监督管理局药品审评中心发布的《药物临床试验数据管理与统计分析计划指导原则》（2021年）的相关要求。统计单位依据上述法规履行统计人员职责，保证遵循已批准的方案进行统计分析和数据处理，保证本研究所有信息、数据真实准确、完整无误，且不用于其他临床试验。主要疗效终点（第12周NT-proBNP较基线变化百分比）采用协方差分析（ANCOVA）模型，以基线NT-proBNP为协变量进行校正，同时纳入分层因素进行校正。假设检验采用双侧α=0.10，统计效能为85%。随机化比例为2:1:1（KZ-sGC2301 50mg组、KZ-sGC2301 25mg组、安慰剂组），分析时以随机化时的治疗组别为分组依据。主要估计目标采用治疗政策策略，伴发事件的处置方式在统计分析计划中预定义。敏感性分析与亚组分析在方案中预定义，具体亚组因素及分析策略在统计分析计划中明确。次要终点按照预定义的层次检验顺序进行多重性校正。所有有效性评价、安全性评价及其他分析的具体方法将在统计分析计划中详细规定，统计分析计划于数据库锁定前最终确定。在所有受试者（包括脱落和提前终止治疗者）完成最后一次研究访视、完成数据清理及数据库锁定后，对项目进行统一揭盲并开展统计分析。","rationale":"ANCOVA基线校正、分层校正、双侧α=0.10、效能85%、随机2:1:1、治疗政策策略估计目标、层次检验顺序校正均来自当前项目已确认研究事实。GCP统计职责表述及SAP锁定前确定、统一揭盲后分析为监管共性结构参照。分层因素的具体变量清单、亚组因素列表、伴发事件处置具体方式需医学经理确认。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（α、估计目标、伴发事件）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_c2b4f6b36cfa_73cc137494e32af6","section_number":"9.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:2591f2474764bad43f94f2ce","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_56b96348f0f97cd896c4:r5:3b8925778cb6ff75","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3152bfe8bf762f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:2bfb4cb52d6d07","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a3cf98aab983c7","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:46d82ed9e2e3ef","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261015080613_9420285e","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_56b96348f0f97cd896c4:revision:5","quote":"主要终点ANCOVA基线校正；分层校正；敏感性分析与亚组分析预定义；次要终点按层次检验顺序校正","quote_sha256":"9177f28597ae5aefeffcc86e4d542f225fb20ca1f7620073f40ab8fc82d7521a","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_56b96348f0f97cd896c4:r5:3b8925778cb6ff75","span_id":"es_003"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_56b96348f0f97cd896c4:revision:5","quote":"第12周NT-proBNP较基线变化百分比（中心实验室）","quote_sha256":"e777be2e531186c75bac394b932a9171a08569e18bcb0166caf7ea5e61a9665e","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_56b96348f0f97cd896c4:r5:3b8925778cb6ff75","span_id":"es_004"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_56b96348f0f97cd896c4:revision:5","quote":"主要终点ANCOVA基线校正；分层校正；敏感性与亚组分析预定义；次要终点层次检验","quote_sha256":"362651d366de6c31219acf0fb577b1064726ef7d07d0494d52cf495f1190b61f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_56b96348f0f97cd896c4:r5:3b8925778cb6ff75","span_id":"es_005"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_56b96348f0f97cd896c4:revision:5","quote":"双侧α=0.10、效能85%，每组85例总计255例（含脱落补偿）","quote_sha256":"c01b830c42bf6a7ed1dc31d8d39332caf74ecca6643431e33eea621343f01d30","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_56b96348f0f97cd896c4:r5:3b8925778cb6ff75","span_id":"es_006"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_56b96348f0f97cd896c4:revision:5","quote":"安慰剂匹配双模拟对照，随机2:1:1（高剂量/低剂量/安慰剂），双盲","quote_sha256":"85987a4a57e6d50e7ee5d4148e4576b6850146838b44368fa4c5292250dd1e8e","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_56b96348f0f97cd896c4:r5:3b8925778cb6ff75","span_id":"es_007"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_56b96348f0f97cd896c4:revision:5","quote":"治疗政策策略主要估计目标，伴发事件处置预定义","quote_sha256":"d009c5539527e8c1f91b4a5cf381f9337364ec5866e0eec8431325e4ec9b8729","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_56b96348f0f97cd896c4:r5:3b8925778cb6ff75","span_id":"es_009"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_003","es_004","es_005","es_006","es_007","es_009"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":6},"gap_items":[{"action":"需医学经理确认次要终点完整列表及预定义层次检验顺序","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_secondary_endpoints","missing_source_classes":["次要终点定义文件"],"target":"次要疗效终点列表及层次检验顺序"},{"action":"需确认亚组因素（如基线NT-proBNP水平、NYHA分级等）及分析策略","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_subgroup_factors","missing_source_classes":["亚组分析方案"],"target":"亚组分析具体因素"}],"heading":"有效性数据分析","missing_source_classes":["次要终点完整列表","层次检验顺序定义","亚组分析因素清单","伴发事件处置方式"],"proposal_text":"主要疗效终点为第12周NT-proBNP较基线变化百分比，由中心实验室统一检测。统计分析在全分析集上进行，采用ANCOVA模型，以基线NT-proBNP值为协变量，以治疗组别（KZ-sGC2301 50mg组、KZ-sGC2301 25mg组、安慰剂组）为固定效应，同时纳入分层因素进行校正。假设检验采用双侧α=0.10，统计效能为85%。主要终点分析以治疗政策策略为主要估计目标，伴发事件的处置方式在统计分析计划中预定义。敏感性分析包括：在符合方案集上重复主要终点分析；采用混合效应模型重复分析以评估缺失数据机制的影响；按基线NT-proBNP水平、NYHA分级等预定义亚组进行分析。次要疗效终点按照预定义的层次检验顺序进行多重性校正，具体次要终点列表及检验顺序在统计分析计划中明确。各治疗组间比较包括KZ-sGC2301 50mg组与安慰剂组、KZ-sGC2301 25mg组与安慰剂组，以及两个活性剂量组之间的比较。","rationale":"主要终点（第12周NT-proBNP较基线变化百分比、中心实验室）、ANCOVA基线校正、分层校正、双侧α=0.10、效能85%、2:1:1随机、治疗政策策略估计目标、层次检验顺序校正、敏感性分析与亚组分析预定义均来自当前项目已确认研究事实。次要终点具体列表及层次检验顺序的完整定义未在当前来源中给出。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（α、主要终点、估计目标、伴发事件）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_c2b4f6b36cfa_638cb48dfb8825fd","section_number":"9.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:2591f2474764bad43f94f2ce","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_56b96348f0f97cd896c4:r5:3b8925778cb6ff75","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3152bfe8bf762f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:2bfb4cb52d6d07","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a3cf98aab983c7","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:46d82ed9e2e3ef","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261015080613_9420285e","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_56b96348f0f97cd896c4:revision:5","quote":"治疗期TEAE发生率与严重程度；生命体征/ECG/实验室异常；症状性低血压","quote_sha256":"9a3b0f677ca78b44b2fe710678c6161f77044a3058485053680c6716b8936d50","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_56b96348f0f97cd896c4:r5:3b8925778cb6ff75","span_id":"es_002"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_56b96348f0f97cd896c4:revision:5","quote":"安全性终点：治疗期TEAE发生率与严重程度；生命体征/ECG/实验室异常；症状性低血压","quote_sha256":"f8549b4978ce8209d5fc1411a29b450e113aaa1c7d1160a5b8a98deb6c79524a","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_56b96348f0f97cd896c4:r5:3b8925778cb6ff75","span_id":"es_008"},{"locator":"section:文档开头|block:29|chunk:1","quote":"首次使用研究药物后的所有不良医疗事件作为AE记录。整个研究期间均需记录。","quote_sha256":"f88028a750330bc20bd005d714d3bab0f12453fcb100ac3db69ab4527d8e1eb3","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","span_id":"es_012"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_002","es_008","es_012"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":1,"project_fact_spans":2},"gap_items":[{"action":"需确认安全性随访终点及TEAE采集窗口的具体天数","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_teae_window","missing_source_classes":["安全性随访方案"],"target":"TEAE采集窗口（末次给药后天数）"},{"action":"需医学经理确认症状性低血压的收缩压/舒张压具体数值及伴随症状定义","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_hypotension_threshold","missing_source_classes":["安全性事件判定标准"],"target":"症状性低血压判定阈值"},{"action":"需确认因果关系判定采用五级分类或其他标准","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_causality_criteria","missing_source_classes":["AE分类标准文件"],"target":"AE因果关系判定标准"}],"heading":"安全性数据分析","missing_source_classes":["TEAE采集窗口定义","症状性低血压判定阈值","安全性随访终点定义","AE因果关系判定标准"],"proposal_text":"安全性分析在安全性分析集上进行，以实际接受的治疗组别为分组依据。不良事件（AE）的采集自首次使用研究药物（KZ-sGC2301或匹配安慰剂）后开始，整个研究期间均需记录；首次使用研究药物前由受试者报告或研究者观察到的任何不良医疗事件，无论与试验药物是否有因果关系，均判为安全性信息而非不良事件，作为病史记录在原始病历中。安全性终点包括：治疗期TEAE发生率与严重程度、生命体征异常、心电图异常、实验室检查异常及症状性低血压。安全性数据按治疗组别、系统器官分类（SOC）及首选术语（PT）进行汇总，描述各组的不良事件发生率、严重程度分布及与药物的因果关系判定。对症状性低血压事件，按发生时间、严重程度、持续时间及转归进行描述性分析。安全性分析以描述性统计为主，不预设假设检验。","rationale":"安全性终点（TEAE发生率与严重程度、生命体征/ECG/实验室异常、症状性低血压）来自当前项目已确认研究事实。AE采集起始时点（首次用药后）及用药前事件处理规则参照公司语料中的通用定义结构。安全性分析集成员规则（至少接受一次给药）依据治疗期安全性终点定义。TEAE采集窗口的具体天数、症状性低血压的判定阈值（如收缩压/舒张压具体数值）未在当前来源中明确，不得自行推断。","review_advisories":["本节引用公司语料形成共性表述；定稿时请用本项目权威文件复核适用性。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_c2b4f6b36cfa_05b9143fe12b4b5f","section_number":"9.5","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:2591f2474764bad43f94f2ce","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_56b96348f0f97cd896c4:r5:3b8925778cb6ff75","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3152bfe8bf762f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:2bfb4cb52d6d07","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a3cf98aab983c7","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:46d82ed9e2e3ef","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"bfe900d285833ecee0ef8876f866703911549eefaebe699e7f0cb465988cb417","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_c2b4f6b36cfa_d32f1403e36f9644:full-draft:2591f2474764bad43f94f2ce","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:2591f2474764bad43f94f2ce","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:7229634723277c379be3a99d4611fda439d7e6ff2650264fc5bc232e6c02c8ce:2591f2474764bad43f94f2ce","text_sha256":"bfe900d285833ecee0ef8876f866703911549eefaebe699e7f0cb465988cb417"},{"content_sha256":"db6e25d19d6b